    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "Hi, everybody.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CEA7DAC337",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "Ban-gap-seum-ni-da.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "24CF3BCF98",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "playing my life",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7D67F76FD5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "I might look successful and happy being in front of you today, but I once suffered from severe depression and was in total despair.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "81678B1576",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 51,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "grave burden",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D6AF113C19",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 81,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "meaningless noise",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E6689FC31A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "When I was just about to give everything up after years of suffering, I started to rediscover the true power of music.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D0D6EB5BDC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 72,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "restored my soul",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E8B42395E3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 72,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "eye-opening experience",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EEB2715F8F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "Do you feel like you are all alone?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8E2CD16C87",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 28,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "touch and heal your heart",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2A7C4B21CB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "(Music) (Applause) Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3CDC677DA5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "Now, I use my music to reach people's hearts and have found there are no boundaries.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BBF4895BAD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "My audience is anyone who is here to listen, even those who are not familiar with classical music.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "96D591AE35",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 185,
        "endOffset": 206,
        "text": "just to mention a few",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5E62B7617E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 207,
        "text": "I not only play at the prestigious classical concert halls like Carnegie Hall and Kennedy Center, but also hospitals, churches, prisons, and restricted facilities for leprosy patients, just to mention a few.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "245E941E8F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 113,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "rock you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "53778EE320",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 37,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "show you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1C0B4C0736",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 122,
        "text": "Now, with my last piece, I'd like to show you that classical music can be so much fun, exciting, and that it can rock you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0177BBA712",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "Let me introduce you to",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5110E197E1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "Let me introduce you to my brand new project, \"Baroque in Rock,\" which became a golden disc most recently.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "40050ACC55",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "It's such an honor for me.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0EF358EC09",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 116,
        "text": "I think, while I'm enjoying my life as a happy musician, I'm earning a lot more recognition than I've ever imagined.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "158C59CD2C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "But it's now your turn.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6FC9CBC528",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "not only...but also",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AFDE980448",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "Changing your perspectives will not only transform you but also the whole world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "372ED6A0BB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "Just play your life with all you have, and share it with the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B96268BBBB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 57,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "by you, TEDsters",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A58B178418",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "I really look forward to witnessing a transforming world by you, TEDsters.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "14EA7FA91D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "Play your life, and stay tuned.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "592FBEA49C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
